  "releaseNotes": "# AID v2.2.1\n\n## 中文更新说明\n\n- 错误处理页将本地错误、已提交报告及自愿附带的排查资料统一保留 7 天，并区分报告发送状态与官方人工处理进度。\n- 诊断报告改为逐条提交并强制绑定唯一请求；服务器只读排查资料必须先完成连接验证，避免重复报告或资料静默遗漏。\n- 图片模型新增结构化图层分离输出，按顺序保存底图、透明图层及尺寸、层级、位置等元数据；Seedream 5.0 Pro 可通过独立能力启用该官方模式。\n- 图片计费支持按每张实际输出的像素档位结算，预冻结按最大输出估算并只退不补；无法读取、格式或透明通道不合法的图层结果会失败退款，不会留下已扣费的半成品。\n- 后台补充图层分离能力和逐张像素档位计费编辑，并改进诊断授权、连接验证、提交进度及人工处理状态展示。\n- Web 用户端本次没有代码变化；自由画布不在本次发布范围。\n- 数据库升级执行 `sql/v2.2.1.sql`。已在隔离 MySQL 5.7 库验证新安装、从 `v2.2.0` 升级、从最早公开版本按顺序升级，以及本版 SQL 重复执行；升级前仍需备份数据库、配置与用户媒体，并在维护窗口暂停媒体任务写入。\n\n## English Release Notes\n\n- Extended local error, submitted report, and optional troubleshooting-data retention to seven days, and separated delivery state from official handling progress.\n- Bound each diagnostic submission to exactly one request and required successful connection verification before attaching read-only server troubleshooting data.\n- Added structured image-layer outputs with ordered background and transparent layers plus dimensions, stacking order, and placement metadata. Seedream 5.0 Pro can enable its official layer-decomposition mode independently.\n- Added per-output pixel-tier settlement. Pre-authorization uses the maximum estimate and settlement only refunds; unreadable or invalid layer results fail and refund instead of leaving charged partial output.\n- Added admin controls for layer decomposition and per-image pixel tiers, with clearer authorization, connection-verification, submission, and handling-status feedback.\n- The Web client is unchanged in this release; the unfinished free-canvas feature is not included.\n- Apply `sql/v2.2.1.sql` when upgrading. Isolated MySQL 5.7 tests covered fresh installation, upgrade from `v2.2.0`, the full ordered chain from the earliest public version, and repeat execution. Back up data, configuration, and user media first, and pause media writes during migration.",
